#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:18
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "Démarrage"

#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:22
msgid ""
"BuddyPress Job Manager connects WP Job Manager to BuddyPress, adding "
"dedicated Jobs and Resumes tabs to member profiles so employers and "
"candidates can work entirely from their profile."
msgstr ""
"BuddyPress Job Manager connecte WP Job Manager à BuddyPress, en ajoutant des "
"onglets dédiés Offres d'emploi et CV aux profils des membres pour que les "
"employeurs et les candidats puissent travailler entièrement depuis leur "
"profil."

#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:25
msgid ""
"There is nothing to configure to get started. A member who posts a job gets "
"a Jobs tab and a member who publishes a resume gets a Resumes tab. Use the "
"General tab only to control activity-feed updates and application "
"notifications."
msgstr ""
"Tu n'as rien à configurer pour commencer. Un membre qui publie une offre "
"obtient un onglet Emplois, un membre qui publie un CV obtient un onglet CVs. "
"Utilise l'onglet Général uniquement pour gérer les mises à jour d'activité "
"et les notifications de candidature."

#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:32
msgid "Help & Support Resources"
msgstr "Ressources d'aide et de support"

#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:33
msgid ""
"Find the resources you need to get help from us. The documentation is a "
"great place to start; for anything else, our support center is ready."
msgstr ""
"Trouve les ressources dont tu as besoin pour obtenir de l'aide de notre "
"part. La documentation est un excellent point de départ ; pour tout le "
"reste, notre centre de support est prêt."

#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:40
msgid ""
"Our comprehensive guide covers every aspect of the plugin. You will find "
"most of your answers here."
msgstr ""
"Notre guide complet couvre tous les aspects du plugin. Tu trouveras la "
"plupart de tes réponses ici."

#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:45
msgid "Support Center"
msgstr "Centre de support"

#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:46
msgid ""
"Our support center provides top-notch assistance. Reach out any time you "
"need a hand."
msgstr ""
"Notre centre de support fournit une assistance de première classe. Contacte-"
"nous n'importe quand si tu as besoin d'aide."

